{"type":"npc","name":"Argentaurem (Gold)","folder":null,"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":130,"temp":0,"max":130,"details":""},"ac":{"value":26,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":30,"otherSpeeds":[],"details":""},"resistances":[{"type":"physical","value":8,"exceptions":["adamantine"],"doubleVs":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["common","empyrean"],"details":""},"level":{"value":8},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Designed after an old hunting deity's two canines, argentaurem are strong temple guardians. They always come in pairs as a giant gold hound and a smaller, faster silver hound. Since separation is physically and spiritually terrible, they always stay together. When one of the pair is killed, the other fights till the end; however, some fiends and intruders prefer to depart and leave the other to its fate.</p><h2>Built to Order</h2><p>While the original pair of argentaurem were modeled after the twin hounds of an ancient hunting deity, some modern temples have reverse-engineered the process to make guardians of their own, modeled after their deity's sacred animal. Despite their different looks, they must share many traits as the original pair, like one being gold and the other silver. They must also both be the same type of animal. The exact reason for these necessary similarities is unknown, but experiments with different forms have resulted in disastrous results.</p><h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2><p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 64/140/250 gp</p><p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (piercing, slashing), armor (medium, heavy), shield, perception item, skill items (Acrobatics, Athletics, Intimidation, Religion, Stealth, Survival)</p><p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> body, bane, charisma, constitution, energy resistant (spirit, vitality, void), holy, metal, mind, mind shield, sensory (darkvision), strength, sturdy, wild</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Elemental Storm (Pathfinder)","authors":"Jaime Napier","license":"ORC","remaster":true}},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":6},"dex":{"mod":2},"con":{"mod":4},"int":{"mod":1},"wis":{"mod":2},"cha":{"mod":4}},"perception":{"details":"","mod":16,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":18,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":14,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":16,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"athletics":{"base":18},"intimidation":{"base":18},"religion":{"base":16},"stealth":{"base":16},"survival":{"base":18}},"traits":{"value":["construct","holy","metal"],"rarity":"rare","size":{"value":"lg"}}},"_id":"qhVmX1JmdP5ydGg5","img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/portraits/argentaurem.webp","prototypeToken":{"name":"Argentaurem (Gold)","displayName":0,"actorLink":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"width":2,"height":2,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/tokens/argentaurem-gold.webp","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY":0,"fit":"contain","scaleX":1,"scaleY":1,"rotation":0,"tint":"#ffffff","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"displayBars":0,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"negative":false,"priority":0,"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1}},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":[],"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":1,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-es-pf2e/assets/subjects/argentaurem-gold.webp"}},"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":false}},"randomImg":false,"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null},"items":[{"type":"action","name":"Metallic Pair","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>Every argentaurem is created alongside a partner, with one made of gold and the other made of silver. The gold one can make gold claws and gold jaws Strikes and use Growl, while the silver one can make silver claws and silver jaws Strikes and use Retrieve. While within 100 feet of each other, the pair can communicate telepathically. If the pair is more than 100 feet apart, they are both @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.4D2KBtexWXa6oUMR]{Drained 1} and can't remove these conditions in any way. While a pair of argentaurems is two level 8 creatures, each of which rolls its own initiative and has three actions per round, an argentaurem encountered without its partner is a level 7 creature.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"interaction","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"zlbjbVtj6ulKIKD5","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Share Life","system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> An argentaurem and its partner are within 100 feet of each other</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The argentaurem and its partner's Hit Points both become equal to the average of their two totals, rounded down. The argentaurem and its partner can't use this ability again for 1 minute.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["divine","vitality"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":1},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"J3MYOj3wZy6iKcM1","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Share Mind","system":{"actionType":{"value":"free"},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The argentaurem and their partner must both roll a Will save, a Perception check, or an initiative roll</p><p><strong>Requirements</strong> An argentaurem and its partner are within 100 feet of each other</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Both the argentaurem and its partner roll and use the higher of their two results.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["divine","mental"]},"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","deathNote":false},"effects":[],"_id":"Fqguip7t6DJbFbGT","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"melee","name":"Gold Claw","effects":[],"system":{"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["agile","holy","magical"]},"damageRolls":{"XElrL266bvEaGNKg":{"damage":"1d6+14","damageType":"slashing","category":null},"LTmxYhNrMz6rEVTO":{"damage":"1d6","damageType":"bleed","category":"persistent"}},"bonus":{"value":18},"attackEffects":{"value":[]}},"_id":"sJtAaOzumu7H88Vs","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"melee","name":"Gold Jaws","effects":[],"system":{"_migration":{"version":0.942,"previous":{"schema":0.941,"foundry":"13.347","system":"7.3.1"}},"description":{"value":"","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["holy","magical"]},"damageRolls":{"ul8sAMcr4ckzhCOi":{"damage":"2d12+14","damageType":"piercing","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":18},"attackEffects":{"value":[]}},"_id":"G3IemzPlBxky4okh","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"1Lps0mi7tMJnjtuv":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null,"coreVersion":"13.347","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"7.4.2"}},{"type":"action","name":"Expose Flank","system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"description":{"value":"<p>When a pair of argentaurems are adjacent to the same creature, they are always flanking it, regardless of their positions.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"rules":[{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.attributes.flanking.canGangUp","value":true}],"slug":null,"traits":{"other